<title>USA: Crowley, Milner &amp; Co Q3 Nov 2 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Crowley, Milner &amp; Co Q3 Nov 2 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 0.52     loss	$ 0.76</p>
<p> Net loss		     686     loss	   735</p>
<p> Revs			41,255		   24,964</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,320			956</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 2.03     loss	$ 3.87</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,191     loss	 3,735</p>
<p> Revs			86,022		   69,920</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,077			956</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 results include three months of profits and two months of sales of Steinbach Stores which was acquired by Crowley, Milner effective August 31, 1996.</p>
<p>1995 results include operations of Crowley, Milner only.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
